<title>UK: World Bank sets 1.0 trillion lire 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 1.0 trillion lire 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 TRLN LIRE COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.076   PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.251    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  1.825     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
